  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759230,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1001 Spikes - Nintendo 3DS Synopsis\n\nEmbark on a perilous journey in *1001 Spikes* for Nintendo 3DS, a challenging platformer inspired by classic 8-bit titles. As Aban Hawkins, son of a missing archaeologist, you must navigate the treacherous Ukampa Ruins in South America, seeking answers about your father's disappearance and uncovering a forgotten legacy.\n\nPrepare for an unrelenting gauntlet of deadly traps, including sharp spikes, poison darts, falling blocks, and flamethrowers. Starting with 1,001 lives, you’ll need intense concentration, memorization, and precise timing to survive. The game features increasingly difficult levels, demanding mastery of its mechanics.\n\nDeveloped by 8bits Fanatics and Nicalis, *1001 Spikes* offers both single-player and multiplayer modes. Originally named *Aban Hawkins & the 1001 Spikes*, this Nintendo 3DS version delivers the same exhilarating, albeit punishing, gameplay experience that captivated players on other platforms. Discover the truth behind your father’s fate and reach the Golden Shrine – if you can survive the onslaught!"
    },
